WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.475 --> 00:00:18.097
Ben pulled the rest of his body out of the tree.

2
00:00:18.937 --> 00:00:21.438
He leaned over the storm drain and peered in.

3
00:00:22.859 --> 00:00:24.340
Water rushed by below.

4
00:00:26.381 --> 00:00:27.142
He groaned.

5
00:00:27.942 --> 00:00:30.023
"Winnie's gift is gone.

6
00:00:30.123 --> 00:00:31.384
What am I going to do now?"

7
00:00:32.044 --> 00:00:34.086
Ben felt the kitten swat at his ankle.

8
00:00:34.106 --> 00:00:36.968
He turned around.

9
00:00:36.988 --> 00:00:41.072
"Winnie's going to hate me," he grumbled.

10
00:00:41.092 --> 00:00:44.374
"And it's all your fault."

11
00:00:45.775 --> 00:00:46.596
It was getting late.

12
00:00:46.616 --> 00:00:51.620
"Winnie and Gaby will be back at Winnie's house soon," Ben thought.

13
00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.822
"I need to get over there."

14
00:00:55.884 --> 00:00:57.365
Ben floated to Winnie's house.

15
00:00:59.187 --> 00:01:05.035
He felt so miserable, he hardly noticed the kitten following him, still swatting at his feet.

16
00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:13.242
here!" Mog shouted as Ben entered.

17
00:01:13.822 --> 00:01:15.103
The kitten followed him in.

18
00:01:20.147 --> 00:01:20.888
Ben mumbled.

19
00:01:20.908 --> 00:01:25.051
"It's Monster Academy's most famous chef!"

20
00:01:25.732 --> 00:01:27.173
a two-headed monster said.

21
00:01:27.193 --> 00:01:28.754
"Check it out!"

22
00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:30.476
A ghoul held up a pan.

23
00:01:30.984 --> 00:01:32.725
"It's your mac and cheese, Ben!"

24
00:01:33.606 --> 00:01:34.726
A witch ran over.

25
00:01:34.746 --> 00:01:38.869
"We grabbed it during the hot sauce explosion.

26
00:01:40.449 --> 00:01:43.051
We figured we could eat it during the party."

27
00:01:43.071 --> 00:01:45.832
"Oh, wow," Ben said.

28
00:01:46.293 --> 00:01:47.914
That made him feel a little better.

29
00:01:48.694 --> 00:01:49.655
Deb waved to him.

30
00:01:49.675 --> 00:01:51.215
"Can you help me, Ben?"

31
00:01:52.096 --> 00:01:54.717
She was stringing spiderwebs across the walls.

32
00:01:55.238 --> 00:01:59.260
The long, thin strands of silk spelled out "Happy Birthday, Winnie!"

33
00:02:00.904 --> 00:02:02.305
"Sure. What do I do?"

34
00:02:02.605 --> 00:02:03.326
Ben asked.

35
00:02:03.346 --> 00:02:05.608
"I finished the words.

36
00:02:06.208 --> 00:02:08.049
Now I want to make a design around them.

37
00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:10.071
Here, hold this."

38
00:02:10.912 --> 00:02:15.335
Deb handed Ben the ball of spider silk that she was using to make the design.

39
00:02:17.757 --> 00:02:22.260
Meow! The kitten leaped up and swatted the ball out of Ben's hand.

40
00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:23.921
"Ack!" Ben cried.

41
00:02:24.522 --> 00:02:27.484
The kitten ran after the ball, batting it around.

42
00:02:29.364 --> 00:02:33.445
As the ball rolled away from the web, the message was ripped away too.

43
00:02:34.946 --> 00:02:38.186
Soon all of Deb's hard work trailed after the kitten.

44
00:02:38.887 --> 00:02:40.287
Ben shot after the kitten.

45
00:02:40.307 --> 00:02:41.807
"Come back here!

46
00:02:41.887 --> 00:02:43.108
You can't play with that!"

47
00:02:45.909 --> 00:02:50.310
Meow! The kitten ran under a table and between a werewolf's ankles.

48
00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:52.750
The werewolf was holding a punch bowl.

49
00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:58.212
"Whoa!" The werewolf lost his balance, and the punch bowl flew out of his hands.

50
00:02:59.036 --> 00:03:01.818
It landed with a splash on an octopus monster.

51
00:03:01.838 --> 00:03:05.521
"There goes the newt punch," a goblin said.

52
00:03:05.541 --> 00:03:08.723
"I spent a lot of time making that!"

53
00:03:09.064 --> 00:03:09.864
a witch said.

54
00:03:09.884 --> 00:03:11.866
"It's Winnie's favorite!"

55
00:03:12.526 --> 00:03:14.147
Ben was still chasing the kitten.

56
00:03:16.729 --> 00:03:20.212
It had leaped onto a table and was now batting around a bug cake.

57
00:03:20.232 --> 00:03:23.514
"Whose kitten is this?"

58
00:03:24.095 --> 00:03:25.456
a three-eyed monster yelled.

59
00:03:26.364 --> 00:03:30.066
She snatched the bug cake away from the kitten and put it back on its plate.

60
00:03:30.706 --> 00:03:33.487
Meow! The kitten stepped onto the plate.

61
00:03:33.507 --> 00:03:36.729
"Shoo!" the three-eyed monster cried.

62
00:03:37.229 --> 00:03:39.870
Startled, the kitten scrambled down the table.

63
00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:43.152
Cups, bowls, and snacks flew everywhere.

64
00:03:44.072 --> 00:03:45.673
Ben felt hot all over.

65
00:03:47.214 --> 00:03:48.874
First he'd lost Winnie's present.

66
00:03:50.595 --> 00:03:52.116
Now he was ruining her party.

67
00:03:53.684 --> 00:03:58.127
Finally the kitten leaped onto a sofa and started cleaning herself.

68
00:03:59.007 --> 00:04:00.448
Waldo looked at the mess.

69
00:04:04.711 --> 00:04:06.031
I guess we should clean this up.

70
00:04:06.472 --> 00:04:09.273
Gaby and Winnie will be here—" "Right now!"

71
00:04:09.754 --> 00:04:12.015
Mog cried, peeking out the window.

72
00:04:12.035 --> 00:04:15.397
"Gaby and Winnie are walking up the driveway!"

73
00:04:15.417 --> 00:04:18.479
"There's no time to clean up," Waldo said.

74
00:04:18.499 --> 00:04:19.980
"Places, everyone!"

75
00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.482
All the monsters scurried into hiding places.

76
00:04:24.303 --> 00:04:27.766
Ben shot an annoyed look at the kitten and ducked behind a chair.

77
00:04:27.786 --> 00:04:32.270
"Winnie's going to be so surprised," someone whispered.

78
00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.912
"Shh!" someone else whispered.

79
00:04:35.632 --> 00:04:39.195
Ben heard several giggles as everyone waited for the door to open.

80
00:04:39.215 --> 00:04:42.618
Meow! The kitten went to Ben.

81
00:04:42.638 --> 00:04:44.199
"Go away!"

82
00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:45.400
Ben whispered.

83
00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:46.581
"Leave me alone!"

84
00:04:46.601 --> 00:04:49.704
"Shh!" Waldo hissed.

85
00:04:50.476 --> 00:04:53.717
Frowning, Ben scooped up the kitten and held it tightly.

86
00:04:54.257 --> 00:04:59.159
A second later the front door opened, and Winnie and Gaby walked in.

87
00:04:59.959 --> 00:05:01.079
Everyone jumped out.

88
00:05:01.099 --> 00:05:07.101
"Surprise!" Winnie's eyes went wide.

89
00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:10.762
She looked at Gaby, who was grinning down at her.

90
00:05:10.782 --> 00:05:12.982
"I'm shocked!"

91
00:05:13.443 --> 00:05:15.363
Winnie said, smiling widely.

92
00:05:15.383 --> 00:05:18.064
"I had no idea you guys were doing this!"

93
00:05:19.068 --> 00:05:20.930
Then she looked around at the mess.

94
00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:23.051
"What happened in here?"

95
00:05:23.832 --> 00:05:25.373
Ben floated over to her.

96
00:05:25.393 --> 00:05:28.936
"Hey, Winnie.

97
00:05:29.436 --> 00:05:30.818
This is actually my fault.

98
00:05:31.178 --> 00:05:32.999
You see, I—" Meow!

99
00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:36.762
The kitten leaped from Ben's hands and into Winnie's arms.

100
00:05:37.423 --> 00:05:38.384
Winnie gasped.

101
00:05:38.904 --> 00:05:40.785
"Is this for me?"

102
00:05:41.826 --> 00:05:43.167
Ben didn't know what to say.

103
00:05:43.187 --> 00:05:46.570
"Uh "A black kitten!

104
00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:48.672
It's so cute!"

105
00:05:49.192 --> 00:05:50.493
She snuggled the kitten.

106
00:05:50.513 --> 00:05:54.556
"Let's get this party started!"

107
00:05:54.976 --> 00:05:55.756
Mog shouted.

108
00:05:57.097 --> 00:06:01.400
He turned on some monster music and pushed the furniture to the edges of the room.

109
00:06:02.921 --> 00:06:04.782
A few monsters cleaned up the mess.

110
00:06:06.163 --> 00:06:08.645
And soon everyone was dancing and eating.

111
00:06:11.927 --> 00:06:13.368
Winnie turned toward Ben.

112
00:06:13.888 --> 00:06:15.710
"What a perfect birthday gift.

113
00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:18.872
How did you know I wanted a black kitten?"

114
00:06:19.852 --> 00:06:22.433
Ben shrugged, glancing down at his shoes.

115
00:06:22.453 --> 00:06:30.256
"Actually—" Just then a popular song, "Midnight Magic," started blaring through the speakers.

116
00:06:30.276 --> 00:06:32.898
"Let's dance!"

117
00:06:33.438 --> 00:06:36.439
Winnie cried, rushing toward the middle of the living room.

118
00:06:41.521 --> 00:06:42.982
Ben hurried after her.

119
00:06:43.002 --> 00:06:46.263
"Sounds good to me!"
